     vices one by one after resuming the laptop:

           # geli suspend -a
           # zzz
           <resume your laptop>
           # geli resume -p -k keyfile gpt/secret
           # geli resume gpt/private
           Enter passphrase:

     To create a ggeellii encrypted filesystem with a file as storage device fol‐
     low this example.  First a file named private0 is created in _/_u_s_r and at‐
